#N canvas 40 40 700 460 12;
#X text 20 20 Cut It -- entry point on the Organelle. mother.pd loads this file by name. Keep it thin: it instantiates u_root and nothing else., f 52;
#X obj 20 120 u_root 17;
#X text 20 250 The 17 is the Pd channel the nanoKONTROL's own channel 1 lands on. It is Pd INPUT SLOT 2 here \, per /root/.pdsettings \, and slot n gets channels (n-1)*16+1 upward. main-dev.pd passes 1 instead \, because on the Mac the nano is the only input opened. This is the ONE line the two entry points are allowed to disagree about., f 52;
#X text 20 170 The Mac entry point is main-dev.pd \, which adds u_mother-stub. It ships in this folder and the device never loads it., f 52;
